<title>USA: Tufco Technologies names new president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Tufco Technologies names new president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tufco Technologies Inc said Wednesday it has named Louis LeCalsey III president and chief executive.</p>
<p>LeCalsey succeeds Carl Francis, who decided to retire effective September 19, the date of the company's third quarter board meeting.</p>
<p>LeCalsey joined Tufco in April as president of its industries division.</p>
<p>Tufco is a specialty printer and converter of custom paper and nonwoven materials.</p>
